// Resource script: embed the comctl32 v6 manifest into TEST targets only.
//
// `1 24` = CREATEPROCESS_MANIFEST_RESOURCE_ID (1), RT_MANIFEST (24).
//
// LANGUAGE 0, 0 (neutral) is deliberate: Tauri's own `libresource.a` (linked
// into BIN targets via `rustc-link-arg-bins`) embeds RT_MANIFEST/ID 1 with
// language 1033. Using the neutral language here keeps the two resource
// identities distinct so the linker does not report a duplicate, while Windows
// still resolves a neutral-language manifest for the test binary (which has no
// other manifest).
LANGUAGE 0, 0

1 24 "test.manifest"
